window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><i>Halfling House is thrumming with love, laughter, and more magick than a witch's cauldron at midnight.</i></p> <p>Reinvigorated from her near-death experience and Zeus's unexpected declaration, Ellie is adjusting to life with magick at her fingertips again. But with three halflings to corral and a perilous Australian bushfire at the back door, she doesn't have much time to dwell on it.</p> <p>When a young wolf shifter goes missing during a tragic accident, it's up to Ellie and Clara to help the Faoladh find her. But finding the wolf among the bushfires is only the beginning, as a centuries old prophecy comes to bear on the Faoladh with heartbreaking consequences—unless Ellie can find a way to help them all.</p> <p>Follow Ellie, Clara, and the halflings as they navigate the hassles of everyday life, their extraordinary battles with the magickal, and the mysteries of Briarmoor, the town they call home.</p>"; 
